n":"BINARY_UNCERTAIN","source_ids":["src_trendlyne_consensus","src_marketscreener_brokers"],"verification_status":"VERIFIED","independent_validation":true},{"claim_id":"current_relative_strength","evidence_category":"OTHER","statement":"On September 22, Upstox showed SONACOMS around INR 803.10, up about 0.99% intraday at 14:01 IST from a previous close of INR 795.25, while Nifty Auto finished about 0.29% lower and Nifty 50 about 0.36% lower, indicating one-day relative strength.","materiality":"MODERATE","direction":"POSITIVE","source_ids":["src_upstox_price","src_investing_niftyauto","src_reuters_india_market"],"verification_status":"VERIFIED","independent_validation":true},{"claim_id":"macro_risk","evidence_category":"SECTOR_MACRO","statement":"The September 22 Indian session was risk-off overall, with Nifty 50 down about 0.36%; foreign outflows and geopolitical uncertainty remained headwinds even as oil prices eased.","materiality":"MODERATE","direction":"NEGATIVE","source_ids":["src_reuters_india_market"],"verification_status":"VERIFIED","independent_validation":true}],"limitations":["Web price evidence is snapshot/delayed and not a substitute for the engine's authenticated market evidence.","No fresh quarterly results have been released since Q1 FY27; the September 17 Jefferies Forum presentation is strategic communication rather than a new earnings event.","Broker targets are opinion evidence and are treated as valuation/sentiment context, not as factual price forecasts.","The DENSO transaction and related restructuring remain subject to applicable shareholder/regulatory/closing conditions where relevant."]}}